<h1>You've been invited to join <%= @team.name %>!</h1>

<p>Hi there,</p>

<p><%= @inviter.email %> has invited you to join the team <strong><%= @team.name %></strong> on LeaguePal.</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Accept Invitation", @invite_url, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
</p>

<p>If you didn't expect this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.</p>